          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Saulo odhiro wac ri Yese ni, “Amaro Daudi. Weyi go wodoŋ ka wotiy ran.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo, kisi ka Rwoth odhiro ri Saulo cuny m'ocido Daudi oyido mako tongol pere to goyo. Cuny m'ocido oyido weyo go to doko Saulo winjo maber.",
          "type": "text",
